SUMMARY:Mahaiwe Rumba - Salsa Class with Luana
DESCRIPTION:RESERVE\n\nFREE\, Reservations required   \nA 60-minute class before César Orozco’s concert on the mainstage to break the ice\, teach the crowd fundamental steps\, and build energy so that the moment the band starts playing\, the dance floor is already packed and moving. 
URL:https://mahaiwe.org/event/mahaiwe-rumba-salsa-class-with-luana/
